; Exactly two, not four. Counts rather than messages, so a host that
; reported both levels fails as a count mismatch rather than quietly
; matching on the first of a pair.
;
; The precedent for the rule is `:requires`' self-reference carve-out in
; the cycle walk: a self-loop is a cycle, and the more specific
; diagnostic wins rather than both being reported in different words.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code positional_too_many :severity err :path [entry buffer])
  (diagnostic :code positional_missing  :severity err :path [pair]))
